{"text": "SEP 22 \"93 03:35,\n\nPHILIP MORRIS\n\nusa\n\nSrevew C. Pawns 122 060300\n\nJune 29, 1993\n\nEXPRESS MAIL RETURN RECEIPT\n\nMr. John F. Banzhaf, II\nExecutive Director & Chief Counsel\nAction on Smoking and Health\n2013 H Street, N.W.\nWashington, DC 20006\n\nDear Mr. Banzhaf:\n\nOn April 6, 1993 you appeared on the\nMacNeil/Lehrer NEWSHOUR and displayed 3 items you\nclaimed carried Philip Mortis trademarks. On April 7, I\ninformed you that our company has a firm policy that\nprohibits the distribution of promotional items directed\nto'children. I asked you to provide us with the items so\nthat we could take immediate action to prevent anyone\nfrom distributing them. On April 8, you refused to turn\nthe items over to Philip Morris, but offered to allow us to\nexamine and photograph them.\n\nOn April 20, I provided you with a copy of our\nadvertising and promotion code, and I represented that\n\u201cPhilip Morris does not sanction the use of its tobacco\ntrademarks on products intended for use by children.\u201d 1\nalso agreed to immediately take quick and forceful action\nto halt the unauthorized use of our tobacco brand names\n\u2018on items intended for use by children. In addition, I\nagreed to advise you in writing and in detail as soon as\npossible of the action we take. Finally, I pointed out that\nalthough it would be easler for us to proceed if we have\npossession of the items, I would accept your condition\nthat we merely examine and photograph them.\n\n2oesssez02", "words": [{"text": "SEP", "x0": 95, "y0": 106, "x1": 113, "y1": 114, "conf": 79.0}, {"text": "22", "x0": 120, "y0": 106, "x1": 132, "y1": 114, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "\"93", "x0": 141, "y0": 106, "x1": 157, "y1": 114, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "03:35,", "x0": 163, "y0": 105, "x1": 194, "y1": 113, "conf": 54.0}, {"text": "PHILIP", "x0": 328, "y0": 150, "x1": 399, "y1": 172, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "MORRIS", "x0": 407, "y0": 150, "x1": 496, "y1": 172, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "usa", "x0": 